==German==

===Noun===
'''Sozialparasit''' {{g|m}} (''plural'' '''[[Sozialparasiten]]''')

# {{lb|de|biology}} Literally, "social [[parasite]]", a parasite of social animals utilizing common resources; e.g. [[wasp]]s that live in [[beehive]]s or [[bumblebee]] nests, feeding on [[honey]] or [[larvae]].
# {{lb|de|pejorative}} [[welfare parasite]]

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|welfare parasite}} {{l|de|Sozialschmarotzer}}, {{l|de|Zecke}}

